You learn to finely craft and tune your spells, reducing all their cooldowns by [6%, 13%, 20%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)].

In doing so you can also carve a hole in spells that affect an area to avoid damaging yourself.  The chance of success is [20%, 40%, 60%, 80%, 100% (TL1-5)].

In addition, you hone your damaging spells to spellshock their targets. Whenever you deal damage with a spell you attempt to spellshock them with [49, 66, 79, 90, 100 (TL1-5; SP 100)] more Spellpower than normal. Spellshocked targets suffer a temporary 20% penalty to damage resistances.
